<th id="S4.T1.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   N   </th>
<th id="S4.T1.1.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Inclusion criteria   </th></tr>
</thead>
