<td id="S4.T1.1.1.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Age prediction   </td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   169   </td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Raw image age prediction MAE <math id="S4.T1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq</annotation></semantics></math> 3.0   </td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.1.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_td" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;"></td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Quality assessment   </td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   812   </td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Raw image with good quality; DR prediction ACC <math id="S4.T1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\geq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≥</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\geq</annotation></semantics></math> 0.85   </td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.1.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
