<td id="S4.T1.1.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Age prediction   </td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   150   </td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Raw image with good quality; Age prediction MAE <math id="S4.T1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq</annotation></semantics></math> 3.0   </td></tr>
