<td id="S4.T1.1.1.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   150   </td>
<td id="S4.T1.1.1.6.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_border_bb" style="padding-left:22.8pt;padding-right:22.8pt;">   Same as above   </td></tr>
