<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Fig. 3: </span>Comparative analysis of image quality degradation across age obfuscation methods. Each column represents a different method: (a) Original image, (b) Blur-based method, (c) DP-Blur, (d) Noise injection, (e) Adversarial perturbation, (f) De-identification, (g) K-Anonymity, (h) RetinaGuard.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="S4.T5" class="ltx_table">
